    skos:definition "Scheduled events and sessions for time periods: Day, Week, Quarter, and Year."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Calendar is a major spaces for time-based linked notes in Obsidian Ideaverse vault in a PKM system, as well as a synced Neo4j subgraph within a PKM knowledge graph.\n- Supported by API routes, Python services, scripts, and agents, as well as Swift apps, intents, widgets, shortcuts, and Siri.\n- Also represented by Calendar and Fantastical apps."@en ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-25T19:12:01Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-08-25T19:12:01Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
